OL,4,B'Pass, pass, slow, slow' - Man City's  
OL,5,Bslick machine grinding to a halt       
OL,6,GManchester City's slick footballing    
OL,7,Gmachine is starting to grind to a halt.
OL,9,FThe quick passing patterns and edge-of-
OL,10,Fthe-seat action that was evident for   
OL,11,Fso long under former manager Pep       
OL,12,FGuardiola was supposed to be taken     
OL,13,Fforward by incumbent Enzo Maresca.     
OL,15,FIt started flawlessly under the        
OL,16,FItalian with the side winning their    
OL,17,Ffirst eight games, but that smooth     
OL,18,Foperation is beginning to turn into a  
OL,19,Fturgid and pedestrian showing.         
